3_214","At this rate, we're all getting the axe anyway. When was the last time her output actually spiked?",9,""],["w",0.5],["say","Eye of Grace Scholar","The day she took an interest in the monitors, I think. We even gave her a photo capturer to play with.",9,""],["w",0.5],["say","Eye of Grace Scholar","But that peak only lasted a few days before plummeting right back to baseline.",9,""],["w",0.5],["say","Eye of Grace Scholar","We tried giving her other toys after that… But, well, you saw what happened.",9,""],["w",0.5],["say","Eye of Grace Researcher","Dang it. What are we supposed to put in the report? If we keep stalling on deliverables, the board is going to—",9,""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,true,1.0],["w",1.0],["se","se_526_stop"],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,1],["se","se_005"],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","wog_lab",0,1.0],["w",1.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["se","se_048"],["chd",0,1,"avg3_185","a","007",null],["ctl","avg3_185","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","Eye of Grace Scholar","Wait, someone's coming. Is that... Director Igna?",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_052"],["chd",0,0,"avg3_214","a","004",null],["ctl","avg3_214","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","Eye of Grace Researcher","Internal Investigations? What's she doing down here?",0,""],["w",0.5],["show","avg3_205","a","002",0.8,null,null,0,null,0.0],["chd",1,1,"avg3_185","a","002",null],["chd",1,0,"avg3_214","a","002",null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_205","a",null,null,0.75,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuad",1.0],["w",1.0],["bgm",""],["ctl","avg3_205","a","007","attention",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_205","Word around the office is you're burning through funds on a ... fascinating little project.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_205","a","014","music",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_205","Handing them a superweapon would certainly make you untouchable here.==W== Shame my recent audits suggest you're nowhere close to pulling it off.",0,""],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg3_205","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.5],["se","se_062"],["ctl","avg3_205","a",null,null,0.6,null,null,null,null,"OutQuad",0.8],["stg",0,-200.0,-30.0,1.2,"OutQuad",0.8,null,null,null],["w",1],["ctl","avg3_205","a","014","love",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_205","If you don't mind, perhaps I could put in a good word with the higher-ups.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_169"],["trn",0,0,true,true,1.0],["w",1.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",1,1],["bg","wog_academy_office",0,1.0],["w",1.0],["show","avg1_120","a","003",null,-0.07,1.1,0,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.5],["mrt",1,"z","025","sweaty",null],["say","avg3_100","Can't believe they had experiments like that running...",1,""],["bgm","m38"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_120","a","003","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_120","From what I've gathered, the procedures weren't physically harmful, but the psychological toll was devastating.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_120","a","007",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_120","They can call her the perfect vessel all they want.==W== But at the end of the day, she was still just a kid—",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_120","a","020",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_120","a","007",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_120","Locked in a lab all day before she could even form a sense of self...==W== It'd completely warp her personality.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_120","a","010","exclamation",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_120","a","020",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_120","Back then, Firefly was more machine than human.==W== Or rather, she tri